1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:01,120
The metal that makes

2
00:00:01,090 --> 00:00:02,620
Wolverine unbreakable...

3
00:00:02,590 --> 00:00:04,910
is poisoning him.

4
00:00:05,010 --> 00:00:05,840
In the comics,

5
00:00:05,810 --> 00:00:06,620
the Weapon X program

6
00:00:06,590 --> 00:00:07,760
bonded adamantium

7
00:00:07,730 --> 00:00:09,580
to his entire skeleton.

8
00:00:09,550 --> 00:00:10,820
Unbreakable bones.

9
00:00:10,790 --> 00:00:12,090
Unbreakable claws.

10
00:00:12,130 --> 00:00:13,820
So why isn't he dead?

11
00:00:13,790 --> 00:00:14,560
His healing factor

12
00:00:14,530 --> 00:00:15,760
never clocks out.

13
00:00:15,730 --> 00:00:17,080
Every second, it's repairing

14
00:00:17,050 --> 00:00:18,200
what that metal does to him

15
00:00:18,170 --> 00:00:19,330
from the inside.

16
00:00:19,330 --> 00:00:20,400
Marvel's tested it.

17
00:00:20,370 --> 00:00:21,100
When Magneto ripped

18
00:00:21,070 --> 00:00:22,160
the adamantium out,

19
00:00:22,130 --> 00:00:22,900
his healing factor

20
00:00:22,870 --> 00:00:24,420
nearly turned him feral.

21
00:00:24,390 --> 00:00:25,000
And when the X-Men

22
00:00:24,970 --> 00:00:26,530
briefly lost their powers?

23
00:00:26,670 --> 00:00:27,680
Logan got sick.

24
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:29,720
Advanced adamantium poisoning.

25
00:00:29,690 --> 00:00:30,740
So Wolverine runs

26
00:00:30,710 --> 00:00:31,620
on two powers

27
00:00:31,590 --> 00:00:33,180
that are always at war.

28
00:00:33,150 --> 00:00:34,100
Take away the metal,

29
00:00:34,070 --> 00:00:35,750
and the healing makes him wild.

30
00:00:35,790 --> 00:00:37,050
Take away the healing...

31
00:00:37,030 --> 00:00:38,640
and the metal kills him.

32
00:00:38,610 --> 00:00:39,660
That's the Wolverine we meet

33
00:00:39,630 --> 00:00:41,690
in the 2017 film Logan.

34
00:00:41,790 --> 00:00:43,260
Older. Scarred.

35
00:00:43,230 --> 00:00:43,680
His healing

36
00:00:43,650 --> 00:00:45,260
finally losing ground.

37
00:00:45,230 --> 00:00:46,560
The thing that made him unbreakable...

38
00:00:46,530 --> 00:00:48,870
was breaking him the whole time.
